ió después; la base no reparte su cifra","sdet":"el Nomenclátor de ese año trae el total del municipio, pero no el detalle de núcleos y diseminado; no es un cero","nf":"el fichero oficial de esa elección no trae este municipio; no es un cero","nx":"sin resultado propio en esa elección: la fuente da sus votos junto con los de otro municipio (véase el municipio histórico)","u1900":"en 1900 formaba parte de un ayuntamiento mayor: su cifra va en el municipio histórico de 1900","dud":"la cifra de 1900 de su ayuntamiento está en duda (las lecturas de la fuente no coinciden) y no entra; no es un cero"},"mot":[[0,0,"d"],[0,1,"d"],[0,2,"d"],[0,3,"d"],[0,4,"d"],[0,5,"d"],[0,6,"d"],[0,7,"d"],[0,8,"d"],[0,9,"d"],[0,10,"d"],[0,11,"d"],[0,12,"d"],[0,13,"d"],[0,14,"d"],[0,15,"d"],[0,16,"d"],[0,17,"d"],[0,18,"d"],[0,19,"d"],[0,20,"d"],[0,21,"d"],[0,22,"d"],[0,23,"d"],[0,24,"d"],[0,25,"d"],[0,26,"d"],[0,27,"d"],[0,28,"d"],[0,29,"d"],[0,30,"d"],[0,31,"d"],[0,32,"d"],[0,33,"d"],[0,34,"d"],[0,35,"d"],[0,36,"d"],[0,37,"d"],[0,38,"d"],[0,39,"d"],[0,40,"d"],[0,41,"d"],[0,42,"d"],[0,43,"d"],[0,44,"d"],[0,45,"d"],[0,46,"d"],[0,47,"d"],[0,48,"d"],[0,49,"d"],[0,50,"d"],[0,51,"d"],[0,52,"d"],[0,53,"d"],[0,54,"d"],[0,55,"d"],[0,56,"d"],[0,57,"d"],[0,58,"d"],[0,59,"d"],[0,60,"d"],[0,61,"d"],[0,62,"d"],[0,63,"d"],[0,64,"d"],[0,65,"d"],[0,66,"d"],[0,67,"d"],[0,68,"d"],[0,69,"d"],[0,70,"d"],[0,71,"d"],[0,72,"d"],[0,73,"d"],[0,74,"d"],[0,75,"d"],[0,76,"d"],[0,77,"d"],[0,78,"d"],[0,79,"d"],[0,80,"d"],[0,81,"d"],[0,82,"d"],[0,83,"d"],[0,84,"d"],[0,85,"d"],[0,86,"d"],[0,87,"d"],[0,88,"d"],[0,89,"d"],[0,90,"d"],[0,91,"d"],[0,92,"d"],[0,93,"d"],[0,94,"d"],[0,95,"d"],[0,96,"d"],[0,97,"d"],[0,98,"d"],[0,99,"d"],[0,100,"d"],[0,101,"d"],[0,102,"d"],[0,104,"d"],[0,105,"d"],[0,107,"d"],[0,108,"d"],[0,109,"d"],[0,112,"d"],[0,113,"d"],[0,114,"d"],[0,115,"d"],[0,119,"d"],[0,120,"d"],[0,122,"d"],[0,126,"d"],[0,128,"d"],[0,130,"d"],[0,131,"d"],[0,133,"d"],[0,136,"d"],[0,138,"d"],[0,140,"d"],[0,141,"d"],[0,142,"d"],